  "horizon": "next calendar year (annual)",
  "label_source": "India Flood Inventory v3 via deterministic LGD-to-Census mapping",
  "label_reliability": "PRESENCE-ONLY: the inventory lists events; a year with no record is treated as 'none recorded' for this target, which is not proof that no flood happened. Districts with no recorded event at all are indistinguishable from unmapped ones and are excluded, which may overstate flood-proneness.",
  "limitations": [
    "Negatives mean 'no record', not 'confirmed no flood'.",
    "Only 502 of 640 districts; unmapped districts have no flood prediction.",
    "Annual district target; no flash-flood or event-timing information."
